<title>USA: R.R. Donnelley &amp; Sons Co Q4 net up.</title>
<headline>R.R. Donnelley &amp; Sons Co Q4 net up.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.66		    $0.62</p>
<p> Net			 97,151		   95,432</p>
<p> Revs		   1,871,935		1,998,271</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 147,504		  153,714</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Excluding one-time items, 1996 Q4 EPS were $0.51.  </p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.04   profit	 $1.95</p>
<p> Net loss		 157,623   profit     298,793</p>
<p> Revs		   6,598,958		6,511,786</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 151,830		  153,483</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Excluding one-time items, 1996 12-mos EPS were $1.51. One-time items include $435 million after-tax restructuring charge and $48 million after-tax gain on initial public offering of Metromail and of DESI.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
